  assistant: I found the root cause of the issue in the SummarizingConversationManager class, specifically in the _generate_summary_with_model method.

The problem is that when summarizing, the method passes all conversation messages, including those with assistant role and structured output (toolUse) in the content, as user messages to the model. This violates the AWS Bedrock Converse API restriction that user messages cannot contain tool uses.

I applied a fix by preprocessing messages in _generate_summ...
